    "es": "Empecé a hacer las tablas de más gente famosa, pero resultó tan deprimente y morboso que tuve que salir fuera. El tipo del sombrero gana otra vez.",
    "en": "I started to do the tables for more famous people but it got really depressing and morbid and I had to go outside. Hat guy wins again.",
    "noteEn": "The official title is Actuarial, an adjective, while the Spanish archive title Actuario names the professional. The Spanish body also adapts the official description of repeated comment spam as se puso a escribir, while preserving the same trolling setup."
  },
