      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "puso",
      "answerEn": "started; began (with se puso a)",
      "noteEn": "Puso is a past form of poner. In se puso a followed by an action verb in its unchanged dictionary form, the complete pattern means that someone started doing that action.",
      "example": { "es": "Marta se puso a correr.", "en": "Marta started running." },
      "tags": ["word", "poner", "preterite", "starting", "A2"]
