      "promptEs": "pasé",
      "answerEn": "I spent (time doing something, as part of me pasé)",
      "noteEn": "Pasé is a completed past form of pasar. With me and a stated period, me pasé describes how long the speaker spent doing an activity; the activity can follow in a form ending in -ando or -iendo.",
      "example": { "es": "Me pasé una hora limpiando.", "en": "I spent an hour cleaning." },
