      "promptEs": "diciéndole",
      "answerEn": "telling him",
      "noteEn": "Diciendo is the -iendo form of decir used for an activity in progress, and le is attached to identify the recipient. The written accent keeps the original stress after le is added. In other contexts, le can mean “to her” or polite “to you.”",
      "example": { "es": "Siguió diciéndole la verdad a Pablo.", "en": "She kept telling Pablo the truth." },
